<title>JAPAN: BOJ to hold briefing after 'tankan' survey.</title>
<headline>BOJ to hold briefing after 'tankan' survey.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan said on Friday it will hold a news briefing on its &quot;tankan&quot; quarterly business survey at 10 a.m. (0100 GMT) on November 27 after releasing the survey results at 8.50 a.m. that day.</p>
<p>It said the news briefing would be given by Masayuki Matsushima, director of the BOJ's Research and Statistics Department.</p>
